ng", "id": "1017968672039348", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974845_1017968675372681_3537640423345626257_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=d-kJNt0q__YQ7kNvwHkO_vB&_nc_oc=AdqK8P5L3mlTvx3Obn_zkAHTDhHJ7jcsgxaEZkjacyJ_iBkiRrkIkTq2vKnXoaVckkw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTq2Zps1b-XtrZjgl_yHphy-uqqhpm92_y01dbX8C0vRA&oe=6B01EE86"}, "display_name": "TEOC", "keywords": ["arcade", "puzzle", "casual", "atmospheric", "puzzler"], "long_description": "Evolve from an atomic state to marine-life in this spatial arcade puzzler with just one goal: Consume or be Consumed! \n\nPowered by elemental forces and mythical artifacts navigate your way through 3 environments with 30+ rounds each to get through. Will you be able to top the leaderboard for each of these? \n\nTEOC provides\u2026\n\u2022 more than 5 hours of mesmerizing gameplay,\n\u2022 a beautiful minimalist style with ambient adaptive soundtracks,\n\u2022 10+ game mechanics to master,\n\u2022 additional powerups to collect and use across all 90+ rounds\n\u2022 with daily powerup rewards for coming back\n\u2022 to compete on the 3 leaderboards,\n\u2022 increasingly challenging level design all procedurally generated\n\u2022 and seated or standing play options!\n\n\n", "short_description": "Evolve from an atomic state to marine-life in this spatial arcade puzzler with just one goal: Consume or be Consumed! \n\nPowered by elemental forces and mythical artifacts navigate your way through 3 environments with 30+ rounds each to get through. Will you be able to top the leaderboard for each of these? With >5 hours of mesmerizing gameplay, 10+ game mechanics to master and all set in a beautiful minimalist style with ambient adaptive soundtracks, you can enjoy it seated or standing up!\n"}]}, "developer_name": "HEADGEAR GbR", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://headgear.io/legal.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "htt